$DATUM Enache, Livia A.; Kennedy, Isaac; Sullins, David W.; Chen, Wei; Ristic,
Dragan; Stahl, Glenn L.; Dzekhtser, Sergey; Erickson, Robert A.; Yan,
Changren; Muellner, Frank W.; Krohn, Michael D.; Winger, Jennifer;
Sandanayaka, Vincent; Singh, Jasbir; Zembower, David E.; Kiselyov, Alex
S.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Organic Process Research & Development (2009), 13(6), 1177-1184

