$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM Synthesis of 4-(4-([1,1'-biphenyl]-2-yloxy)phenoxy)benzoic acid (4). To a
round-bottomed flask equipped with a Dean-Stark trap,
4-(bipheny2-yloxy)phenol (1.90 g, 7.2 mmol), p-fluorobenzonitrile (0.88
g, 7.2 mmol), and K2CO3 (1.50 g, 11 mmol) were charged. Then, NMP (16 mL)
and toluene (16 mL) were added into the flask under nitrogen. The
reaction mixture was stirred at 150 °C for 2 h. After removal of toluene,
the reaction temperature was increased to 180 °C and the reaction was
continued for 16 h. After cooling to room temperature, the mixture was
poured into water and acidified with 1 N HCl (aq). The resulting
precipitate was collected and charged in a round bottomed flask. KOH (15
g, 0.23 mol), H2O (50 mL), and ethanol (100 mL) were added to the flask
and the mixture was refluxed overnight. After removal of ethanol by
distation, the mixture was cooled to room temperature and poured into
water and acidified with conc. HCl aq. The resulting precipitate was
collected and recrystallized from ethanol and water (1/1, v/v). White
powder, yield 2.43 g, 88%. Mp: 193.0-193.5 °C. IR (KBr, ν, cm-1): 1227
(-O-), 1682 (-COOH). 1H NMR (DMSO-d6, δ, ppm): 6.96 (d, J = 9.0 Hz, 4 H),
7.06 (d, J = 9.0 Hz, 3 H), 7.25-7.54 (m, 8 H), 7.92 (d, J = 9.0 Hz, 2 H).
13C NMR (DMSO-d6, δ, ppm)): 116.55, 119.34, 119.63, 121.42, 124.26,
124.94, 127.09, 128.02, 128.80, 129.01, 131.03, 131.41, 132.73, 137.11,
149.94, 153.08, 153.69, 161.27, 166.52. Anal. Calcd for C25H18O4: C,
78.52; H, 4.74. Found: C, 78.86; H, 4.91.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):NOTES
$DATUM Dean-Stark trap used in stage 1
